  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalysing Action for SDG Acceleration in Mozambique &#x2013; SDG Project, Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Catalysing Action for SDG Acceleration in Mozambique &#x2013; SDG Project, Phase II aims to expedite the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development in Mozambique. Running from July 2024 to June 2027, this project focuses on four critical areas: multistakeholder engagement, strengthening statistical systems, policy analysis, and mobilizing new sources of finance for the SDGs. Implemented by the Ministry of Economy and Finance with support from UNDP, the project seeks to enhance</narrative>
  </description>
